 "description": "Server Technology PRO4X Smart, 0U: a 1778.2 mm strip for a rack's vertical channel. It has 36 outlets, 12 HDOT C13 and 24 HDOT Cx, in two banks of eighteen either side of a controller panel. The panel has a colour LCD, two Ethernet ports, a PDU link port, a sensor port and USB ports. Each bank has three branch breakers, and neighbouring outlets sit on different breakers. It is the Smart unit of the 16 A family the maker's outline drawing is titled for.",
